WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.250
A new Game of Thrones teaser trailer is out
– what does it reveal about the final season

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.650
of Thrones?

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.509
We see the Painted Table on Dragonstone – a
big map of Westeros.

00:00:12.509 --> 00:00:18.400
There’s a direwolf representing the Starks;
a dragon, for the Targaryens; and a lion,

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:19.400
for the Lannisters.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:23.369
These are the three main houses left in Season
8.

00:00:23.369 --> 00:00:29.300
Last season’s teaser showed a more complex
political situation, with Houses Baratheon,

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:32.649
Tyrell and Greyjoy entangled with the others.

00:00:32.649 --> 00:00:37.559
But now the Baratheons Tyrells and Martells
are all dead, and the politics of Game of

00:00:37.559 --> 00:00:40.070
Thrones is simpler than it’s ever been.

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:45.650
This final season is less about politics,
and more about ice and fire.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:52.160
An icy fog sweeps across Westeros, symbolising
the white walkers and their army of the dead.

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:57.570
It covers the north, freezing the Stark direwolf
– maybe hinting that Winterfell will fall

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:59.140
to the walkers.

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:04.940
The Targaryen dragon freezes, like how Daenerys’
dragon Viserion is now controlled by the Night

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:05.940
King.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:12.190
In the south, the Lannister lion burns, which
might hint at the deaths of Cersei and Jaime.

00:01:12.190 --> 00:01:17.070
Some speculate that Cersei will die in a fire
– that just like she blew up that Sept,

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:21.950
she might burn down the whole city of King’s
Landing . And in the books, the Lannister

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:25.960
twins believe that they will die together
.

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:31.500
In the middle of Westeros, ice and fire clash
– representing a battle between the living

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:32.760
and the dead.

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:39.180
This happens on the map near the river Trident
– just as Daenerys dreams in Book 3 . But

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:43.950
if the walkers get that far south, they could
have millions of dead northerners in their

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:49.250
army – this war for the dawn will be on
an apocalyptic scale.

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:54.740
Amidst the ice and fire, this black crystal
stuff appears, which might represent dragonglass

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:58.250
– the obsidian that kills white walkers.

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:03.730
And the dragonglass seems to take the shape
of like a wall across Westeros.

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:09.159
In Season 7, there’s a book that says that
dragonfire can be used to reshape dragonglass

00:02:09.159 --> 00:02:14.769
to build things . So maybe Daenerys and her
dragons will shape dragonglass to build a

00:02:14.769 --> 00:02:17.450
Wall, and make the walkers pay for it.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:20.980
Or maybe this is just a cool visual effect.

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:26.980
Either way, this represents a truly epic battle
– the song of ice and fire that the book

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:28.560
series is named for.

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:32.209
But is this really how Game of Thrones will
end?

00:02:32.209 --> 00:02:38.549
After seven seasons of human drama and intricate
politics, will the end be a fantasy battle

00:02:38.549 --> 00:02:41.109
where the good guys beat the bad guys?

00:02:41.109 --> 00:02:46.260
The series creators have said it’ll be more
complex than that . And there is some dark

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:49.909
strange stuff in the prophesies and lore of
Thrones.

00:02:49.909 --> 00:02:54.230
Like, legend says that the last time the white
walkers attacked, they were defeated by a

00:02:54.230 --> 00:03:00.580
hero who sacrificed his beloved wife – so
maybe Jon will kill Daenerys?

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:05.129
And there are hints of cooperation and even
marriage between humans and white walkers

00:03:05.129 --> 00:03:10.159
– maybe Westeros will make a deal with the
walkers, maybe Jon will become the new Night

00:03:10.159 --> 00:03:13.950
King – maybe that’s what the frozen direwolf
means.

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:16.219
There are lots of possibilities.

00:03:16.219 --> 00:03:22.290
So the final season of Thrones won’t have
much time for politics or minor-characters

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:24.099
or travel times making sense.

00:03:24.099 --> 00:03:27.359
It’ll be more fire and ice and CGI.

00:03:27.359 --> 00:03:31.459
But there are still big shocks and revelations
to come.

00:03:31.459 --> 00:03:39.459
Mysteries will be uncovered, Cleganes will
Bowl, and characters we love will die – cause

00:03:39.459 --> 00:03:41.950
the story has nothing to lose now.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:44.719
This is what it’s been building up to.

00:03:44.719 --> 00:03:47.640
There are just six episodes left.

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:53.549
